474 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (This project showed that transfer learning is effective for brain tumor MRI classification. EfficientNetB5 achieved the best internal accuracy, while DenseNet121 generalized best on external data.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
475 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (The Custom CNN improved after regularization but remained weaker than pretrained models. External testing also showed that MRI orientation and label differences can affect performance.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
476 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (In real life, this type of model can support doctors in brain tumor classification, but it should not replace medical experts. Final diagnosis must always rely on doctors and clinical validation.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
